---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import poolDeck from "../assets/images/property/pool-deck.webp";
---

<section class="property" id="property">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>The Property</h2>
    <Image src={poolDeck} class="property__image" alt="Pool deck at FarmCamp" />
    <div class="property__content">
      <h3>Welcome to our new home!</h3>
      <p>
        Previously, Passage was held on a beautiful morsel of land in East
        Alabama and gave us some incredible moments, but was getting a bit
        cramped. As the 2026 reboot approached, we sought a property that was
        more accessible to more people in our communities and offered more space
        for us to grow into.
      </p>

      <p>We found that in the incredible campground FarmCamp.</p>

      <p>
        51 weeks of the year, FarmCamp is a LGBTQ+ Resort offering a sanctuary
        for connection and freedom in a part of the world not exactly known for
        inclusivity. They have our full support and confidence as partners in
        this new iteration of Passage.
      </p>

      <p>
        See more about the property at <a
          href="https://gofarmcamp.com"
          target="_blank">gofarmcamp.com</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .property {
    &__image {
      margin-bottom: 3em;
    }
    &__content {
      max-width: 60ch;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
